  lines:
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f1a52219a36a5425fbc0493a4d791c19, type: 2}
    mood: 1
    text: Processing Plant online, {playerName}! Star 1 earned!
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f1a52219a36a5425fbc0493a4d791c19, type: 2}
    mood: 0
    text: In real lunar engineering (ISRU), melting crater ice and refining regolith
      rocks gives us Water and Parts right here on the Moon.
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f1a52219a36a5425fbc0493a4d791c19, type: 2}
    mood: 1
    text: 'Next mission: the Electrolyser! Look for its glowing ring to turn Water
      into breathable O2 and H2 rocket fuel.'
